<!doctype html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <title>A-CODEAI | 검증 정책</title>
  <meta
    name="description"
    content="A-CODEAI 검증 정책: 투명성, 재현성, 한계 고지, 롤백 제어."
  />
  <link rel="canonical" href="https://a-codeai.com/ko/benchmark/" />
  <link rel="alternate" hreflang="en" href="https://a-codeai.com/benchmark/" />
  <link rel="alternate" hreflang="ko" href="https://a-codeai.com/ko/benchmark/" />
  <link rel="alternate" hreflang="x-default" href="https://a-codeai.com/benchmark/" />
  <meta property="og:locale" content="ko_KR" />
  <meta property="og:locale:alternate" content="en_US" />
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #070e1f;
      --panel: #121f3d;
      --text: #edf2ff;
      --muted: #a7b6d8;
      --line: #263a66;
      --line-strong: #38518a;
      --primary: #86abff;
      --primary-dark: #0a1738;
      --ok: #7ef0c2;
      --warn: #ffd27a;
      --card-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(6, 13, 28, 0.35);
    }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: "Segoe UI", "Noto Sans KR", Arial, sans-serif;
      color: var(--text);
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, #081022, #0d1c3f);
      line-height: 1.55;
    }
    .skip-link {
      position: absolute;
      left: -9999px;
      top: auto;
      width: 1px;
      height: 1px;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .skip-link:focus-visible {
      left: 12px;
      top: 12px;
      z-index: 50;
      width: auto;
      height: auto;
      padding: 8px 12px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      background: var(--primary);
      color: var(--primary-dark);
      font-weight: 700;
      text-decoration: none;
    }
    .container { width: min(980px, 92vw); margin: 0 auto; }
    .topbar { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); background: rgba(7, 16, 36, 0.9); }
    .topbar-inner {
      min-height: 56px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
    }
    a { color: inherit; }
    .lang { color: var(--muted); font-size: 13px; }
    .nav-row { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; align-items: center; }
    h1 {
      margin: 0 0 12px;
      font-size: clamp(30px, 4.8vw, 50px);
      line-height: 1.08;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    }
    .hero { padding: 56px 0 34px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
    .subtitle { margin: 0; color: var(--muted); max-width: 760px; }
    section { padding: 34px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
    h2 { margin: 0 0 10px; font-size: 24px; }
    .card {
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 12px;
      background: rgba(18, 31, 61, 0.65);
      padding: 14px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      box-shadow: var(--card-shadow);
    }
    .pill {
      display: inline-block;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
      border-radius: 999px;
      padding: 2px 8px;
      margin-right: 6px;
    }
    .pill-ok { background: var(--ok); color: #102317; }
    .pill-warn { background: var(--warn); color: #2a1e00; }
    .small { margin: 0; color: var(--muted); }
    .mono { font-family: Consolas, Menlo, monospace; font-size: 13px; color: #d7e2ff; }
    ul { margin: 0; padding-left: 18px; color: var(--muted); }
    .cta-row { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px; }
    .btn {
      display: inline-flex;
      min-height: 44px;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 0 16px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 700;
      border: 1px solid transparent;
    }
    .btn-primary { background: var(--primary); color: var(--primary-dark); }
    .btn-ghost { border-color: var(--line); background: rgba(18, 31, 61, 0.45); }
    .btn-ghost:hover { border-color: var(--line-strong); text-decoration: none; }
    footer { padding: 26px 0 34px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 13px; }
    .ecosystem-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
      gap: 12px;
    }
    .ecosystem-item {
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 12px;
      background: rgba(16, 28, 58, 0.36);
      padding: 14px;
      box-shadow: var(--card-shadow);
    }
    .ecosystem-item a {
      color: #d5e3ff;
      font-weight: 700;
    }
    .ecosystem-item p {
      margin: 6px 0 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 14px;
    }
    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {
      .card,
      .ecosystem-item {
        transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;
      }
      .card:hover,
      .ecosystem-item:hover {
        transform: translateY(-2px);
        border-color: var(--line-strong);
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <a href="#main-content" class="skip-link">본문으로 건너뛰기</a>
  <nav class="topbar" aria-label="Top navigation">
    <div class="container topbar-inner">
      <div><strong>A-CODEAI</strong></div>
      <div class="nav-row">
        <div><a href="/ko/">홈</a> · <a href="/ko/pilot">파일럿</a> · <strong>검증</strong></div>
        <div class="lang">Language: <a href="/benchmark">EN</a> | <strong>KO</strong></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <header class="hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>A-CODEAI Open Bench (Controlled Beta + Waitlist)</h1>
      <p class="subtitle">
        측정된 압축 성능은 재현 가능한 근거와 함께 공개하며, SEND_GATE는 HOLD를 유지하고 온보딩은 대기명단 우선으로 운영합니다.
      </p>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main id="main-content">
    <section>
      <div class="container">
        <h2>검증 원칙</h2>
        <div class="card">
          <span class="pill pill-ok">투명성</span>
          성공 사례뿐 아니라 오탐/미탐을 월 단위로 함께 공개합니다.
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <span class="pill pill-ok">재현성</span>
          명령어와 아티팩트 경로를 남겨 감사 가능한 상태를 유지합니다.
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <span class="pill pill-warn">한계 고지</span>
          오탐/미탐 가능성을 사전 고지하고 운영에 반영합니다.
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <div class="container">
        <h2>현재 증거 스냅샷</h2>
        <div class="card">
          <p class="small"><span class="pill pill-ok">Track A Active (분리 레인)</span> active codec 기준 토큰 절감 47.54%, min jaccard 0.714.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <p class="small"><span class="pill pill-ok">Contributor Open-Bench (분리 레인)</span> 토큰 절감 25.1%, raw alignment pass 63.3% (19/30).</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <p class="small"><span class="pill pill-warn">헤드라인 혼합 금지</span> Track A active 지표와 contributor 지표를 하나의 문구로 합치지 않습니다.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <div class="container">
        <h2>운영 안전장치</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>readiness/health 미충족 시 HOLD/track_a_primary로 자동 폴백</li>
          <li>Track A / Track B 분리 운영으로 승격 거버넌스 유지</li>
          <li>SEND_GATE가 HOLD인 동안 대중 아웃바운드 캠페인 금지</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="open-bench-section">
      <div class="container">
        <h2>오픈 벤치 (Lv.3 · SKU 분리)</h2>
        <div class="card" id="open-bench-banner">
          <span class="pill pill-warn">SEND_GATE</span>
          <p id="open-bench-banner-text" class="small">loading...</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <p class="small">런치 체크리스트</p>
          <p id="open-bench-launch" class="mono">loading...</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <p class="small">원클릭 재현 명령</p>
          <p id="open-bench-reproduce-cmd" class="mono">loading...</p>
          <p class="small">git HEAD: <span id="open-bench-git-head" class="mono">—</span></p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <p class="small">공개 코퍼스 SKU (코퍼스별 측정치만 — 합산 금지)</p>
          <div id="open-bench-sku-table" class="mono">loading...</div>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <p class="small">FAIL-COMP-004 (내부 SKU — 대외 인용 금지)</p>
          <ul id="open-bench-fail-comp"></ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <div class="container">
        <h2>재현 점검 명령 예시</h2>
        <div class="card">
          <p class="mono">bash scripts/deploy/linux/check_a_codeai_public_routes.sh</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <p class="mono">python3 scripts/run_compression_evidence_lv1_chain_v1.py --skip-handoff</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <div class="container">
        <h2>공개 범위 / 비공개 범위</h2>
        <div class="card">
          <p class="small"><span class="pill pill-ok">공개</span> KPI readiness, hard-case gain, 라우트/API 점검, 롤백 및 레인 분리 정책.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <p class="small"><span class="pill pill-warn">비공개</span> 핵심 압축/복원 내부 로직, 후보 생성 내부 로직, 정책 튜닝 상세.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <div class="container">
        <h2>자동 갱신 증거 스냅샷</h2>
        <div class="card">
          <p class="small">실시간 Health 상태</p>
          <p id="health-status" class="mono">loading...</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <p class="small">상용 준비도 (자동)</p>
          <p id="evidence-readiness" class="mono">loading...</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <p class="small">극한 구간 개선치 (자동)</p>
          <p id="evidence-gain" class="mono">loading...</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <p class="small">갱신 정책</p>
          <p class="small">페이지 로드시 `/health`, `/evidence/latest.json`를 `cache: no-store`로 조회해 최신 상태를 표시합니다.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <div class="container">
        <h2>오픈 검증 패키지</h2>
        <div class="card">
          <p class="small">파일럿 전 점검을 위해 라우트 점검, 벤치 읽기 가이드, 운영 경계 체크리스트를 요청할 수 있습니다.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="cta-row">
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://app.jema-ai.com/enterprise/apply">Controlled beta 신청</a>
          <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="mailto:contact@a-codeai.com?subject=%5B%ED%9A%8C%EC%82%AC%EB%AA%85%5D%20%EC%98%A4%ED%94%88%20%EA%B2%80%EC%A6%9D%20%ED%8C%A8%ED%82%A4%EC%A7%80%20%EC%9A%94%EC%B2%AD">검증 패키지 요청</a>
          <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/ko/pilot">파일럿 정책 보기</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="ecosystem">
      <div class="container">
        <h2>MKM 도메인 연결</h2>
        <div class="ecosystem-grid">
          <article class="ecosystem-item">
            <a href="https://jema-ai.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">jema-ai.com</a>
            <p>브랜드/엔터프라이즈 허브. 파트너·제품 진입 분기.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="ecosystem-item">
            <a href="https://mkmlife.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">mkmlife.com</a>
            <p>소비자 원퀘스천 리포트 및 웰니스 중심 UX.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="ecosystem-item">
            <a href="https://jemaai.cloud/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">jemaai.cloud</a>
            <p>비실매매 공개 관측 보드 전용 표면.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <div class="container">
        <div class="cta-row">
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://app.jema-ai.com/enterprise/apply">Controlled beta 신청</a>
          <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="mailto:contact@a-codeai.com?subject=%5B%ED%9A%8C%EC%82%AC%EB%AA%85%5D%20%EC%95%95%EC%B6%95%20%ED%8C%8C%EC%9D%BC%EB%9F%BF%20%EB%AC%B8%EC%9D%98">파일럿 문의</a>
          <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/ko/pilot">파일럿 조건 보기</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <div class="container">
      <p>주식회사 목소리네트워크 · 사업자등록번호 628-86-01742 · <a href="mailto:contact@a-codeai.com">contact@a-codeai.com</a></p>
      <p><a href="https://jema-ai.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">개인정보처리방침</a> · <a href="/ko/legal">법적 고지</a> · <a href="/">홈</a></p>
      <p>© 2026 주식회사 목소리네트워크. 무단 복제를 금지합니다.</p>
    </div>
  </footer>
  <script>
    (async function () {
      var benchBanner = document.getElementById("open-bench-banner-text");
      var benchLaunch = document.getElementById("open-bench-launch");
      var benchCmd = document.getElementById("open-bench-reproduce-cmd");
      var benchGit = document.getElementById("open-bench-git-head");
      var benchTable = document.getElementById("open-bench-sku-table");
      var benchFail = document.getElementById("open-bench-fail-comp");
      try {
        var benchRes = await fetch("/a_codeai_public_bench_landing_payload_v1_latest.json", { cache: "no-store" });
        var bench = await benchRes.json();
        var banner = (bench.sections && bench.sections.banner) || {};
        if (benchBanner) {
          benchBanner.textContent = (banner.title_ko || "") + " — " + (banner.body_ko || "");
        }
        if (benchLaunch) {
          benchLaunch.textContent =
            "decision=" + (bench.launch_decision || "unknown") +
            " pass=" + (bench.launch_pass_count || "?") +
            " send_gate=" + (bench.send_gate || "HOLD");
        }
        if (benchCmd) benchCmd.textContent = bench.one_command_reproduce || "n/a";
        if (benchGit) benchGit.textContent = bench.git_head || "n/a";
        if (benchTable && bench.sections && bench.sections.public_skus) {
          var lines = bench.sections.public_skus.map(function (row) {
            return row.sku_id + " | cases=" + row.case_count +
              " saving=" + row.saving_display + " jaccard=" + row.jaccard_display +
              " sha=" + (row.corpus_sha256 || "").slice(0, 12) + "...";
          });
          benchTable.textContent = lines.join("\n") || "no public skus";
        }
        if (benchFail && bench.sections && bench.sections.fail_comp_004) {
          bench.sections.fail_comp_004.forEach(function (item) {
            var li = document.createElement("li");
            li.textContent = item;
            benchFail.appendChild(li);
          });
        }
      } catch (e) {
        if (benchBanner) benchBanner.textContent = "open-bench payload unavailable";
      }

      var healthEl = document.getElementById("health-status");
      var readinessEl = document.getElementById("evidence-readiness");
      var gainEl = document.getElementById("evidence-gain");
      try {
        var healthRes = await fetch("/health", { cache: "no-store" });
        var health = await healthRes.json();
        var ts1 = new Date().toISOString();
        if (healthEl) {
          healthEl.textContent = "status=" + (health.status || "unknown") + " (checked " + ts1 + ")";
        }
      } catch (e) {
        if (healthEl) healthEl.textContent = "status=unavailable";
      }
      try {
        var evRes = await fetch("/evidence/latest.json", { cache: "no-store" });
        var ev = await evRes.json();
        var cr = ev.commercial_readiness || {};
        var hg = ev.hard_case_gain || {};
        if (readinessEl) {
          readinessEl.textContent = "status=" + (cr.status || "unknown") + " (" + (cr.criteria_passed || 0) + "/" + (cr.criteria_total || 0) + ")";
        }
        if (gainEl) {
          gainEl.textContent = "delta=" + (typeof hg.value === "number" ? hg.value.toFixed(4) : "n/a");
        }
      } catch (e) {
        if (readinessEl) readinessEl.textContent = "evidence=unavailable";
        if (gainEl) gainEl.textContent = "delta=n/a";
      }
    })();
  </script>
</body>
</html>
